#: UndockedGramplets.gpr.py:34
msgid ""
"Monkey Patch that replaces the Close button of gramplets undocked from a "
"sidebar, bottombar or the Dashboard with a Dock button, makes the titlebar "
"close button really close the gramplet, and uses the smart Help button of "
"Markdown Utils when that addon is active."
